WEBVTT

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:01.033
you should at least care for yourself.

00:09:02.193 --> 00:09:05.266
That's because the Hindu Kush
Himalaya mountains --

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:08.741
the entire region
is like the pulse of the planet.

00:09:10.819 --> 00:09:13.191
If the region falls sick,

00:09:13.215 --> 00:09:15.960
the entire planet will eventually suffer.

00:09:17.164 --> 00:09:18.314
And right now,

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:21.646
with our glaciers melting rapidly,

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:23.511
the region is not just sick --

00:09:23.535 --> 00:09:25.361
it is crying out for help.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:30.254
And how will it affect
the rest of the world?